The '''Varkana system''' was a [[star system]] in<ref name="The Missing Agent" /> the [[Outer Rim Territories]]<ref name="Appendix" /> that the ''[[Colossus]]'' passed near during its flight from the [[First Order]]. After picking up a [[Distress signal|distress call]] originating from there on a [[Resistance]] frequency, [[Kazuda Xiono]], [[Jarek Yeager]], [[Synara San]], and [[CB-23]] went to [[Rescue of Norath Kev|investigate]].<ref name="The Missing Agent" />

